cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Nonconformity: find where operational data breaks its own pattern"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Roy
    given-names: Abhik
repository-code: "https://github.com/drabhikroy/nonconformity"
orcid: 0000-0002-7085-8964
abstract: >-
  An open source R Shiny application for reviewing operational time series.
  Classical, transparent methods learn the ordinary rhythm of a series and
  point at the moments that break it, with plain language readings for
  operators and exposed method internals for researchers. An optional
  language model running on the same machine adds interpretation without
  changing any number.
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - time series
  - R
  - Shiny
  - program evaluation
